I am in the living room now.
There is a small wooden table in the corner of the room.
This is my new office desk.
The table is near the window.
I open the window.
A pleasant breeze comes from outside.
January is a good month in Kochi.
I take the laptop from the bag.
I put the laptop on top of the table.
Now the laptop sits securely on the desk.
I put the notebook near the laptop.
My pen lies on top of the notebook.
The empty bag lies under the table.
I put a chair near the desk.
I sit on the chair.
I like the breeze coming through the window.
I am ready to sit here and work.
